cff-version: 1.2.0
title: TDEaseNexus
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Tisen-Ray
repository-code: "https://github.com/Computational-TDMS/TDEaseNexus"
url: "https://github.com/Computational-TDMS/TDEaseNexus"
abstract: >-
  TDEaseNexus (TD通) is an AI-first desktop workbench for top-down mass
  spectrometry data analysis: an agent runtime (Electron + Vue 3), a
  Python/FastAPI backend executing MSConvert/TopFD/TopPIC workflows through
  Snakemake, and a Rust scientific kernel with a domain-skill library for
  open-search census, candidate discrimination, positional-isomer fitting and
  cross-sample quantification. Every intermediate result is stored,
  re-readable and cross-checkable.
keywords:
  - top-down proteomics
  - mass spectrometry
  - AI agent
  - proteoform
  - open-source
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.10.0-beta
message: >-
  If you use TDEaseNexus, please cite this repository with the version you
  used. A versioned software DOI (Zenodo-GitHub) and data-repository DOIs for
  the frozen reproduction package and certified session trajectories are
  added here upon deposit.
